WEBVTT

01:30.880 --> 01:34.950
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.030 --> 01:37.970
[Episode 28]

01:58.870 --> 01:59.670
They're here.

02:17.130 --> 02:19.829
[Gu's Mansion]

02:17.470 --> 02:18.530
Congratulations!

02:18.710 --> 02:20.840
Congratulations, congratulations!

02:21.960 --> 02:23.360
To the groom!

02:23.520 --> 02:24.890
To the bride!

02:25.360 --> 02:27.520
May you live in harmony

02:27.560 --> 02:29.560
and prosperity for a hundred years.

02:29.680 --> 02:31.090
To the groom!

02:31.120 --> 02:32.250
Look to the heavens,

02:32.310 --> 02:35.630
the three stars of Fortune, Prosperity,
and Longevity have arrived.

02:35.630 --> 02:37.800
The star of Fortune comes with joy,

02:37.910 --> 02:40.300
blessings descend from jade vessels,

02:40.430 --> 02:42.829
fortune flows like the endless East Sea,

02:42.870 --> 02:46.000
and endures like the evergreen pines
of South Mountain.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.960
Congratulations to Mr. Gu and Madam Gu

03:19.960 --> 03:20.870
on your joyous union!

03:20.870 --> 03:21.710
Mr. Gu and Madam Gu,

03:21.710 --> 03:23.170
may you grow old together.

03:52.960 --> 03:55.190
First bow to heaven and earth.

04:07.310 --> 04:09.710
Second bow to the parents.

04:14.710 --> 04:16.230
Serve tea.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.500
This bracelet

04:39.870 --> 04:42.200
and the hairpin you're wearing are a pair.

04:42.600 --> 04:43.360
They were both left to me

04:43.360 --> 04:45.000
by his father years ago.

04:45.830 --> 04:47.270
Keep them safe.

04:47.720 --> 04:48.950
Don't let them be separated again.

04:48.950 --> 04:49.920
Got it?

04:50.950 --> 04:52.240
Understood, Mother.

04:54.630 --> 04:57.000
Husband and wife bow to each other.

05:09.040 --> 05:10.720
The ceremony is complete.

05:11.310 --> 05:14.680
Excellent, excellent!

05:14.680 --> 05:15.750
Congratulations.

05:16.430 --> 05:18.510
To the bridal chamber.

05:19.630 --> 05:20.920
Congratulations!

05:21.160 --> 05:24.020
May you have a hundred years
of happiness together.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.920
Congratulations to Mr. Gu and Madam Gu.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.430
May your marriage last a hundred years.

05:27.430 --> 05:28.830
Congratulations!

05:28.920 --> 05:30.410
Congratulations!

05:34.630 --> 05:35.630
Congratulations!

05:35.630 --> 05:37.090
Congratulations, Mr. Gu.

05:56.600 --> 05:58.260
Why don't you sit down, Yu'er?

05:59.680 --> 06:00.510
Help me.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.460
I can't even see in front of me.

06:17.750 --> 06:19.350
Can you help me take this off?

06:23.120 --> 06:24.240
It's too heavy.

06:25.240 --> 06:26.040
My goodness.

06:26.190 --> 06:27.870
It's like wearing a water bucket
on your head.

06:27.870 --> 06:29.040
It was so heavy.

06:29.070 --> 06:30.530
My neck was about to break.

06:31.040 --> 06:32.750
If I had known getting married
would be this tiring,

06:32.750 --> 06:34.080
I wouldn't have done it.

06:53.360 --> 06:54.690
What are you looking at?

06:57.950 --> 06:59.920
If I had known you'd be this beautiful,

06:59.920 --> 07:01.980
I would have married you much sooner.

07:09.950 --> 07:11.190
Welcome. Come in, please.

07:10.400 --> 07:14.630
[Gu's Mansion]

07:16.200 --> 07:17.990
[Boundless Blessings and Children]

07:18.040 --> 07:18.830
Excellent!

07:20.480 --> 07:21.340
Excellent!

07:21.600 --> 07:23.000
Very good!

07:25.040 --> 07:27.170
Congratulations, congratulations!

07:36.390 --> 07:37.240
Excellent!

07:39.000 --> 07:40.000
Announcement!

07:42.790 --> 07:48.500
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

07:43.680 --> 07:44.540
Announcement!

07:45.159 --> 07:47.560
The Prince's Guardian and Royal Appraiser,

07:47.560 --> 07:49.000
also the Imperial Diarist,

07:49.000 --> 07:50.159
Drafter of Imperial Edicts,

07:50.159 --> 07:53.150
Acting Minister of War,
and Commander of Jiangning,

07:53.240 --> 07:54.750
is bestowed
with the Imperial Purple-Gold Belt.

07:54.490 --> 07:57.060
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

07:54.800 --> 07:55.850
Marshal Jiu

07:55.909 --> 07:57.480
has come in person
to offer congratulations,

07:57.480 --> 08:00.430
along with a box of imperial porcelain,

08:00.510 --> 08:03.310
a pair of imperial "Fortune & Longevity"
calligraphy scrolls,

08:03.310 --> 08:05.390
a complete set of white jade tableware,

08:05.390 --> 08:08.540
and a full set of gold-inlaid
zitan wood furniture.

08:07.460 --> 08:10.530
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

08:08.600 --> 08:10.310
Here comes the master.

08:40.669 --> 08:41.669
I'm not late, am I?

08:56.000 --> 08:56.790
Bridegroom.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.390
I heard about what you did

08:58.390 --> 08:59.240
in Shanghai.

08:59.790 --> 09:01.320
It's very much to my liking.

09:04.000 --> 09:04.800
Let me ask you.

09:07.270 --> 09:09.360
You remember the favor you owe me, right?

09:09.360 --> 09:09.840
I do.

09:10.140 --> 09:11.400
There's something now

09:11.630 --> 09:12.960
that needs your involvement.

09:12.960 --> 09:14.270
Can you handle it or not?

09:14.270 --> 09:15.610
Of course he will agree.

09:20.750 --> 09:22.320
You're entrusting me
with an important task.

09:22.320 --> 09:24.520
I'm just afraid I'm not capable enough.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.490
May I ask what the matter is?

09:26.720 --> 09:27.440
Here we go again.

09:27.440 --> 09:29.240
All this pretentious nonsense.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.200
Marshal Jiu's order

09:30.200 --> 09:31.080
must be a matter of national importance.

09:31.080 --> 09:32.750
I'm afraid I'm not capable enough.

09:32.750 --> 09:34.150
Don't make promises on my behalf.

09:34.150 --> 09:35.150
Anxious, are you?

09:50.550 --> 09:52.080
I need you to save the world.

09:53.030 --> 09:53.960
Are you up for it?

09:58.790 --> 10:01.040
I never thought I'd be able to enjoy

10:01.080 --> 10:02.740
such an occasion at my old age.

10:02.840 --> 10:04.940
Heaven has truly been kind to me.

10:05.600 --> 10:07.120
Mr. Gu here...

10:07.440 --> 10:08.200
You got it wrong.

10:08.200 --> 10:08.690
That's right.

10:08.690 --> 10:09.840
You're calling him Mr. Gu again.

10:09.840 --> 10:11.000
-He's your son-in-law now.
-Exactly.

10:11.000 --> 10:11.720
Son-in-law.

10:11.720 --> 10:14.110
Whatever I call him,
the meaning is the same.

10:14.110 --> 10:15.910
People are all born
and raised the same way.

10:15.910 --> 10:17.710
No need for so many formalities.

10:17.870 --> 10:19.440
This Mr. Gu of mine

10:19.870 --> 10:21.200
has the spirit of a true hero.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.360
Whether as my friend

10:22.390 --> 10:23.360
or as my son-in-law,

10:23.360 --> 10:24.560
he's a blessing to me.

10:24.630 --> 10:25.790
That's right.

10:27.670 --> 10:28.760
The war is over,

10:29.270 --> 10:31.530
but look at the state of Nanjing city now.

10:31.910 --> 10:33.680
The Confucius Temple is overgrown
with vegetation.

10:33.680 --> 10:36.120
The Qinhuai River
has turned into a stinking ditch.

10:36.120 --> 10:37.630
The once bustling Confucian temple

10:37.630 --> 10:39.150
is now covered with thorns and vines.

10:39.150 --> 10:39.870
We'll let

10:41.080 --> 10:42.870
the future generation
judge this war for its rights and wrongs.

10:42.870 --> 10:44.440
The most urgent task now

10:44.550 --> 10:46.750
is to improve the situation in Nanjing.

10:47.840 --> 10:49.790
So how exactly should we proceed?

10:54.750 --> 10:55.670
The Liangjiang government office

10:55.670 --> 10:57.120
needs someone with a clean background

10:57.120 --> 10:59.080
with no connections to any faction.

10:59.080 --> 11:01.790
He must also have official status
and understand business.

11:01.790 --> 11:03.200
He needs to properly manage

11:03.200 --> 11:04.390
the Seven Provinces of Jiangnan.

11:04.390 --> 11:05.590
Especially Nanjing,

11:05.960 --> 11:08.910
which has significant importance
both domestically and internationally.

11:08.910 --> 11:10.750
We must at least make people say that

11:10.750 --> 11:12.440
since the imperial court
has reclaimed Nanjing,

11:12.440 --> 11:13.320
the lives of common people

11:13.320 --> 11:14.630
have improved from before.

11:14.630 --> 11:15.750
We certainly can't have people saying

11:15.750 --> 11:17.750
that Nanjing, under
the imperial court's control,

11:17.750 --> 11:19.010
has become even worse.

11:20.670 --> 11:21.320
Yes.

11:21.790 --> 11:22.920
But does this person

11:23.240 --> 11:24.390
have to be me?

11:26.440 --> 11:28.240
Mr. Gu, you're being too modest.

11:31.670 --> 11:33.800
This is exactly what makes him clever.

11:34.030 --> 11:35.750
Always waiting
until others have praised him enough

11:35.750 --> 11:37.550
before he's willing to respond.

11:38.120 --> 11:39.250
That's not the case.

11:39.390 --> 11:40.330
I just feel that

11:40.390 --> 11:41.450
I lack experience.

11:41.840 --> 11:43.030
If I were to

11:43.080 --> 11:44.440
take charge of this situation,

11:44.440 --> 11:45.790
I'm afraid I wouldn't command respect

11:45.790 --> 11:47.720
and would become a laughingstock.

11:47.840 --> 11:48.630
Then tell me,

11:48.670 --> 11:50.510
who else could win everyone's respect?

11:50.510 --> 11:52.320
For example, Li Wantang from the capital,

11:52.320 --> 11:53.630
Wu Caishen from Zhejiang,

11:53.630 --> 11:54.960
Jin Wencai from Shanxi,

11:55.140 --> 11:57.000
and Li Zhongdeng, the famous tea merchant.

11:57.000 --> 11:58.730
Aren't they all better than me?

11:59.840 --> 12:01.640
His words sound better than

12:01.670 --> 12:02.870
those sung on stage.

12:04.630 --> 12:06.120
Since you know them so well,

12:06.120 --> 12:07.360
how much do you know about

12:07.360 --> 12:09.220
the stories behind these people?

12:15.390 --> 12:17.120
I've lost my mood for drinking.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.600
Have a good chat with him.

12:20.630 --> 12:21.390
Don't see me out.

12:21.390 --> 12:26.080
[Wedding]

12:24.000 --> 12:25.240
When he says not to see him out,
then don't.

12:25.240 --> 12:26.370
Don't make trouble.

12:27.480 --> 12:29.000
Look at his guards.

12:29.390 --> 12:30.510
Even the lowest-ranked one

12:30.510 --> 12:33.240
is a second-rank official
wearing an Imperial Yellow Jacket.

12:33.240 --> 12:34.510
Those people you just mentioned

12:34.510 --> 12:36.240
wouldn't even catch his attention.

12:36.240 --> 12:37.390
How laughable.

12:37.480 --> 12:38.240
Then tell me,

12:38.270 --> 12:39.720
who else is more powerful?

12:39.720 --> 12:40.320
Easy.

12:40.670 --> 12:41.960
Why didn't you mention the Emperor

12:41.960 --> 12:43.090
or Empress Dowager?

12:43.120 --> 12:44.650
It seems you still don't understand

12:44.650 --> 12:46.380
what business is really about.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.800
Please enlighten me.

12:50.790 --> 12:51.360
Fine.

12:52.270 --> 12:54.070
Let me explain it to you clearly.

12:56.840 --> 12:57.750
Fill my cup.

13:05.360 --> 13:06.440
Li Million

13:06.870 --> 13:09.330
has the Sixth Prince as his backer.

13:10.220 --> 13:12.750
Wu Caishen is backed by the Left Minister.

13:12.840 --> 13:15.320
As for Li Zhongdeng,
he only rules a single province

13:15.320 --> 13:16.720
and won't amount to much.

13:17.150 --> 13:18.350
Jin Wencai is decent,

13:18.550 --> 13:20.290
but they say he's sickly.

13:21.200 --> 13:22.440
What a sharp tongue you have,

13:22.440 --> 13:24.500
insulting all the heroes of the land.

13:24.930 --> 13:26.200
Marshal Jiu simply doesn't want

13:26.200 --> 13:27.720
the varying forces and the imperial court

13:27.720 --> 13:29.630
to interfere in Nanjing's matters.

13:29.630 --> 13:31.440
But he doesn't have business skills,

13:31.440 --> 13:32.970
so he has to seek out talented people.

13:32.970 --> 13:35.030
The current Viceroy of Liangjiang,
Rui Lin,

13:35.030 --> 13:36.150
has just been transferred here

13:36.150 --> 13:37.120
and has no money.

13:37.240 --> 13:39.070
Jiu is pressuring him

13:39.120 --> 13:40.910
to release the funds
for demobilizing the troops.

13:40.910 --> 13:43.100
Having hundreds of thousands of soldiers
stationed outside the city

13:43.100 --> 13:44.600
is like waiting
for a powder keg to blow up.

13:44.600 --> 13:46.120
You need to help him

13:46.240 --> 13:48.200
solve this problem as a merchant.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.240
I'm afraid that even if I

13:51.240 --> 13:52.570
sacrifice everything,

13:53.390 --> 13:55.520
I still can't contain this powder keg.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.530
You're scared?

14:00.790 --> 14:01.590
Of course I am.

14:02.600 --> 14:04.000
I have my mother and wife.

14:04.390 --> 14:05.590
Of course I'm scared.

14:08.600 --> 14:09.790
Just give us a date

14:10.200 --> 14:10.790
and someone will

14:10.790 --> 14:12.480
escort you to Nanjing.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.630
Whether you can do it or not,

14:14.630 --> 14:17.030
you can decide
after you see the situation.

14:17.910 --> 14:18.550
Aren't you

14:19.270 --> 14:20.440
from the other side?

14:20.840 --> 14:21.750
When did you

14:22.030 --> 14:23.560
join Marshal Jiu's forces?

14:25.390 --> 14:27.120
You've been quite bold lately.

14:27.160 --> 14:28.390
Taking advantage of being a newlywed

14:28.390 --> 14:29.990
and showing no respect to me.

14:30.390 --> 14:31.700
Join Jiu's forces?

14:32.200 --> 14:32.870
Dream on.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.790
I was only 12 when I entered the palace.

14:34.790 --> 14:36.200
But I wouldn't serve the Emperor

14:36.200 --> 14:37.550
and ran away when I had to.

14:37.550 --> 14:38.450
As for Jiu,

14:38.630 --> 14:40.830
he's not even qualified to wash my feet.

14:41.840 --> 14:43.570
Stop asking about my business.

14:43.870 --> 14:44.930
See you in Nanjing.

14:45.360 --> 14:46.200
Congrats.

14:59.480 --> 15:00.080
Brother.

15:00.720 --> 15:02.180
You're really something.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.630
This is the first time
I've seen Marshal Jiu

15:04.630 --> 15:05.790
being so polite to someone.

15:05.790 --> 15:07.120
You're something else.

15:08.630 --> 15:09.960
After this,

15:10.030 --> 15:11.630
all officials in the country

15:11.670 --> 15:13.000
will bow down to you

15:13.030 --> 15:14.760
and be scared out of their wits.

15:15.000 --> 15:15.630
I don't look for trouble;

15:15.630 --> 15:16.790
trouble finds me.

15:17.390 --> 15:18.990
They want me to be the advisor

15:19.000 --> 15:21.130
to Rui Lin, the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

15:23.360 --> 15:26.120
That's like grabbing food
from a hot oil pot.

15:26.200 --> 15:27.960
It's putting you on the hot seat.

15:27.960 --> 15:29.020
This job is no good.

15:29.120 --> 15:29.790
Exactly.

15:29.870 --> 15:30.790
Report!

15:31.270 --> 15:33.110
Master Li Wantang from Beijing

15:33.270 --> 15:35.870
has sent Mr. Li Qin
to offer congratulations

15:36.030 --> 15:38.000
and present a complete set of gifts.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.140
Pingyuan, I wish you good fortune.

15:39.140 --> 15:40.480
Mr. Li, good fortune to you.

15:40.480 --> 15:41.340
Please come in.

15:42.750 --> 15:44.510
I've come to demand an explanation.

15:44.510 --> 15:46.150
Why didn't you tell me about your wedding?

15:46.150 --> 15:47.240
Couldn't spare a wedding drink for me?

15:47.240 --> 15:48.240
How stingy of you.

15:49.120 --> 15:49.600
I thought

15:49.290 --> 15:55.800
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

15:49.630 --> 15:51.230
it was just a modest wedding.

15:51.240 --> 15:52.450
Why trouble you to come

15:52.450 --> 15:53.870
all the way from the capital for this?

15:53.870 --> 15:54.870
I planned to treat you to a drink

15:54.870 --> 15:56.670
when we meet again in the future.

15:56.910 --> 15:58.370
I came in a hurry this time.

15:58.480 --> 15:59.750
If my gifts aren't adequate,

15:59.750 --> 16:01.360
I'll make it up to you next time.

16:01.360 --> 16:01.960
That's all trivial.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.690
-Hello, Mr. Li.
-Hello, Mr. Li.

16:04.550 --> 16:05.810
Last time in Shanghai,

16:05.870 --> 16:07.000
you did me such a huge favor.

16:07.000 --> 16:08.930
I hope it didn't cause you trouble.

16:09.320 --> 16:10.440
What are you saying?

16:10.440 --> 16:12.170
Of course it caused me trouble.

16:13.030 --> 16:14.030
That's why I've been

16:14.030 --> 16:15.690
feeling guilty all this time.

16:16.720 --> 16:18.270
In this world, there aren't many things

16:18.270 --> 16:19.800
that can satisfy everyone.

16:19.910 --> 16:20.960
We can't just do anything

16:20.960 --> 16:22.560
for the sake of making money.

16:22.680 --> 16:24.500
Helping you made me happy.

16:24.840 --> 16:25.600
If my father had won,

16:25.600 --> 16:27.460
I would have felt uncomfortable.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.480
Why so?

16:29.790 --> 16:31.200
If all businesses

16:31.240 --> 16:33.270
depended on currying favor
with the powerful,

16:33.270 --> 16:33.910
wouldn't that discourage

16:33.910 --> 16:35.570
businesspeople everywhere?

16:36.910 --> 16:38.030
For those words alone,

16:38.030 --> 16:39.690
we should have a proper drink.

16:53.770 --> 16:54.370
By the way,

16:54.750 --> 16:55.720
your father doesn't know

16:55.720 --> 16:57.120
you're here with gifts, does he?

16:57.120 --> 16:57.870
He knows.

17:00.000 --> 17:00.550
Father.

17:01.440 --> 17:02.790
Where are you sending me this time?

17:02.790 --> 17:04.790
If it's not urgent, don't bother me.

17:05.720 --> 17:07.180
Busy or not, you have to go.

17:08.190 --> 17:09.260
Give this to him

17:09.550 --> 17:11.270
and pass along a few words.

17:12.109 --> 17:13.109
Who's getting married?

17:13.109 --> 17:13.839
Gu Pingyuan.

17:16.160 --> 17:17.400
Gu... Gu Pingyuan?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.569
Is that strange?

17:20.720 --> 17:21.579
Remember this.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.380
If you can't beat this man,

17:23.589 --> 17:25.849
find a way to become his friend.

17:31.480 --> 17:32.270
And you,

17:32.490 --> 17:33.250
tell him.

17:33.920 --> 17:36.960
He'd better not go to Nanjing if he can.

17:40.240 --> 17:40.750
Go now.

17:42.880 --> 17:43.940
Also, take a look at

17:44.310 --> 17:45.310
what kind of woman

17:45.440 --> 17:47.570
a man like him would choose as his wife.

17:48.880 --> 17:49.510
Got it.

17:50.480 --> 17:52.030
You're giving me too much credit.

17:52.030 --> 17:53.590
How could someone insignificant like me

17:53.590 --> 17:54.720
possibly earn the favor

17:54.720 --> 17:55.960
of a great merchant like your father?

17:55.960 --> 17:57.790
Actually, several times
when I barely escaped death,

17:57.790 --> 17:59.160
he was the one who let me go.

17:59.160 --> 18:01.160
I should be the one giving him gifts.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.840
To have barely escaped death

18:05.000 --> 18:05.920
is a good thing.

18:06.880 --> 18:09.540
There are some things
I can't figure out either.

18:09.960 --> 18:10.480
Why don't you take me

18:10.480 --> 18:11.680
to greet your wife?

18:12.240 --> 18:13.820
Just a brief greeting at the door will do.

18:13.820 --> 18:14.680
Otherwise, I wouldn't know what to say

18:14.680 --> 18:15.810
when my father asks.

18:16.550 --> 18:18.210
Let's go. I'll take you there.

18:29.110 --> 18:30.440
Greetings, Madam.

18:30.640 --> 18:32.430
I'm here to pay my respect.

18:33.350 --> 18:34.510
Greetings, Mr. Li.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.310
We're buddies;

18:38.480 --> 18:40.960
our relationship is naturally
different from others.

18:40.960 --> 18:41.480
Go on in

18:41.480 --> 18:42.720
and chat for a while.

19:07.350 --> 19:07.880
Here.

19:09.750 --> 19:11.200
You're so great.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.530
I knew you'd be hungry.

19:16.750 --> 19:17.480
Smells good?

19:17.880 --> 19:18.640
Tastes good?

19:22.640 --> 19:23.480
It's so good.

19:24.590 --> 19:25.450
Take your time.

19:29.880 --> 19:30.610
Give me a hug.

19:37.160 --> 19:38.090
Enjoy your meal.

19:38.630 --> 19:40.110
If you want more, just tell me.

19:40.110 --> 19:42.370
I'll steal more from the kitchen for you.

19:43.000 --> 19:43.960
Steal, you say.

19:47.400 --> 19:47.960
Who is it?

19:48.000 --> 19:48.590
Mr. Gu,

19:48.750 --> 19:50.000
your buddy Li Qin is leaving

19:50.000 --> 19:51.730
and wants to say goodbye to you.

19:51.820 --> 19:53.280
Okay. I'll be right there.

19:57.670 --> 19:58.880
I'll just have a quick word with him

19:58.880 --> 19:59.880
and be right back.

20:00.070 --> 20:00.790
Go ahead.

20:06.680 --> 20:08.410
Don't just sleep after eating.

20:08.790 --> 20:09.480
Wait for me.

20:11.510 --> 20:12.240
I know.

20:35.830 --> 20:37.830
A moment of spring night
is worth a thousand taels.

20:37.830 --> 20:38.350
Did I

20:38.350 --> 20:40.280
interrupt your romantic evening?

20:40.400 --> 20:41.260
What nonsense.

20:41.350 --> 20:43.410
A true friend is worth more than gold.

20:45.110 --> 20:46.570
Did Marshal Jiu visit you?

20:47.480 --> 20:48.440
They want me

20:48.960 --> 20:50.720
to be the advisor to Ruilin,

20:50.720 --> 20:52.250
the Viceroy of Liangjiang.

20:52.880 --> 20:54.880
Is that what you wanted to ask about?

20:57.640 --> 21:00.440
The situation in Nanjing
is very complicated now.

21:00.510 --> 21:02.880
That place is extremely dangerous
right now.

21:02.880 --> 21:04.610
All factions are active there.

21:05.000 --> 21:06.660
Half of the land is conquered.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.920
Who wouldn't want to get involved

21:08.940 --> 21:10.340
and get a piece of the pie?

21:11.350 --> 21:12.480
But Marshal Jiu,

21:13.160 --> 21:14.890
after years of bloody battles,

21:15.070 --> 21:17.600
would never willingly
give up his interests.

21:17.790 --> 21:19.290
I think he's pushing someone like you,

21:19.290 --> 21:20.610
who fears nothing,

21:20.640 --> 21:21.590
to take the fall.

21:21.680 --> 21:22.510
How vicious.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.400
Your Li family

21:25.720 --> 21:27.580
also wants a foothold in Nanjing?

21:27.690 --> 21:28.290
Of course.

21:29.640 --> 21:31.840
My father was entrusted by His Highness

21:31.920 --> 21:34.200
to take control
of the southern salt administration.

21:34.200 --> 21:36.200
It's a juicy piece of meat after all.

21:39.590 --> 21:40.640
The salt administration is the foundation

21:40.640 --> 21:41.970
of the empire's wealth.

21:42.440 --> 21:43.570
Taking control of it

21:43.680 --> 21:45.210
is indeed a brilliant move.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.810
Before I came, my father

21:48.310 --> 21:49.570
left this matter to me.

21:50.400 --> 21:51.110
Success is

21:51.550 --> 21:52.410
my only option.

21:52.960 --> 21:54.820
So you have to give me some leeway.

21:55.880 --> 21:56.310
Okay.

21:56.720 --> 21:57.520
I promise you.

22:08.000 --> 22:08.730
I don't really

22:08.730 --> 22:09.590
buy your words.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.000
But you saying it

22:12.000 --> 22:13.860
at least honors our brotherhood.

22:14.510 --> 22:15.910
Why don't you believe me?

22:16.070 --> 22:17.310
After I took this assignment,

22:17.310 --> 22:18.970
I thought about it seriously.

22:20.070 --> 22:21.670
Marshal Jiu has his eye on you

22:21.790 --> 22:22.920
and wants to use you.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.550
My father knows that.

22:25.630 --> 22:27.040
The reason he assigned

22:27.070 --> 22:29.030
the salt administration matters to me

22:29.030 --> 22:30.890
isn't because he truly trusts me,

22:31.510 --> 22:33.570
but because he thinks putting me here

22:34.110 --> 22:35.310
will make it harder

22:35.350 --> 22:36.750
for you to do your job.

22:43.960 --> 22:45.890
These people are using us as pawns.

22:48.240 --> 22:49.500
But there's something

22:49.550 --> 22:50.590
I want to tell you.

22:53.200 --> 22:54.720
Even if someday

22:55.720 --> 22:57.590
we brothers truly become

22:57.960 --> 22:58.740
enemies,

23:00.350 --> 23:01.610
business is business.

23:02.640 --> 23:03.590
I won't harm you.

23:07.530 --> 23:08.390
I won't either.

23:30.160 --> 23:31.270
I was afraid you weren't full enough.

23:31.270 --> 23:32.400
So I got you two more.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.310
I'm done eating.

23:34.880 --> 23:36.480
Don't tell anyone else

23:36.640 --> 23:38.000
that I ate so much.

23:43.240 --> 23:44.960
Wow, you're quite particular.

23:44.960 --> 23:46.960
You left just 1 of everything for me.

23:47.920 --> 23:50.180
Didn't you say you wouldn't let me sleep?

23:50.720 --> 23:51.350
Yes.

23:56.170 --> 23:56.830
What for?

23:59.630 --> 24:00.270
What for?

24:01.030 --> 24:02.490
What are we staying up for?

24:03.030 --> 24:03.760
I don't know.

24:05.640 --> 24:06.270
What for?

24:09.640 --> 24:10.110
What for?

24:10.110 --> 24:10.680
What for?

24:10.790 --> 24:11.350
What for?

24:11.400 --> 24:12.530
You tell me what for.

24:14.030 --> 24:14.640
What for?

24:15.830 --> 24:16.480
What for?

24:16.790 --> 24:17.640
I don't know.

24:26.660 --> 24:27.190
What for?

24:29.110 --> 24:29.790
I don't know.

24:29.790 --> 24:30.440
What for?

24:30.510 --> 24:32.640
I don't know what we're supposed to do.

24:38.350 --> 24:39.110
Who is it?

24:39.720 --> 24:40.750
Is she inside?

24:40.790 --> 24:41.790
What are you talking about?

24:41.790 --> 24:43.190
You got the wrong person.

24:43.960 --> 24:45.020
Will this ever end?

24:45.400 --> 24:46.590
His Highness is here.

24:46.590 --> 24:47.720
Which His Highness?

24:48.110 --> 24:48.970
Your Highness.

24:49.640 --> 24:51.440
Have you forgotten the warriors

24:51.640 --> 24:52.850
of Horqin?

24:53.760 --> 24:54.640
Go, hurry.

25:01.680 --> 25:02.620
My goodness, Your Highness!

25:02.490 --> 25:04.330
[Spring Breeze of Yi River]

25:02.680 --> 25:04.210
Everyone, you're all here.

25:10.590 --> 25:11.440
Your Highness.

25:11.440 --> 25:12.590
What brings you here?

25:12.590 --> 25:14.450
I just came from the capital.

25:15.000 --> 25:16.920
I met with the Emperor.

25:17.440 --> 25:19.300
I heard you were getting married.

25:19.590 --> 25:20.390
Why didn't you

25:20.750 --> 25:22.510
tell my wife and me?

25:22.920 --> 25:25.080
Have you forgotten about us?

25:25.400 --> 25:26.960
Never. Not even for a single day.

25:26.960 --> 25:28.510
May Your Highness and Her Ladyship

25:28.510 --> 25:31.110
have endless blessings
and grow old together.

25:33.310 --> 25:35.200
Is this guy treating you well?

25:35.640 --> 25:37.400
I've brought the Horqin warriors

25:37.400 --> 25:38.230
with me.

25:38.680 --> 25:39.920
I'll leave them here

25:40.400 --> 25:41.670
to take good care of you

25:42.400 --> 25:44.730
so no one will bully you.

25:44.790 --> 25:45.200
Gosh.

25:45.200 --> 25:46.750
Your Highness, what are you saying?

25:46.750 --> 25:48.270
How would I dare bully Yu'er?

25:48.270 --> 25:48.880
Besides,

25:49.270 --> 25:50.750
these warriors are the brothers

25:50.750 --> 25:52.370
who escorted me back to Anhui.

25:52.370 --> 25:54.410
[Spring Breeze of Yi River]

25:52.880 --> 25:54.540
How could I order them around?

25:56.640 --> 25:58.190
I've come from so far away,

25:58.400 --> 26:00.490
how about giving me a warm welcome?

26:01.480 --> 26:02.400
Gosh, where are my manners?

26:02.400 --> 26:04.000
I'll go prepare the banquet.

26:08.160 --> 26:08.690
Pingwen.

26:09.680 --> 26:10.610
What's going on?

26:11.270 --> 26:12.000
I don't know.

26:12.160 --> 26:13.480
A group of people arrived

26:13.480 --> 26:14.790
claiming to work for His Highness.

26:14.790 --> 26:17.720
- They even drove away the cook.
-Your Highness, you're here.

26:17.720 --> 26:18.220
Your Highness,

26:18.220 --> 26:19.200
please go to the small tent nearby

26:19.200 --> 26:19.920
to change your clothes.

26:19.920 --> 26:20.440
This way, please.

26:20.440 --> 26:22.350
Aren't my clothes fine as they are?

26:22.350 --> 26:24.210
You're wearing Han clothing.

26:24.110 --> 26:26.650
[Gu's Mansion]

26:24.350 --> 26:25.480
For our princess's wedding,

26:25.480 --> 26:27.010
you cannot dress like this.

26:27.030 --> 26:28.960
His Highness would be displeased.

26:39.000 --> 26:40.720
