26:42.440 --> 26:44.160
When poured into a glass for you,

26:44.160 --> 26:45.920
it becomes a liquor fierce as a tiger.

26:45.920 --> 26:47.640
Our songs ring out loud.

26:47.680 --> 26:49.200
And friendship runs deep.

26:49.280 --> 26:51.030
Please have a drink.

26:51.110 --> 26:52.790
What's sealed in the bottle

26:52.880 --> 26:54.480
is the warmth of friendship.

