Our songs ring out loud.

28:44.750 --> 28:46.210
And friendship runs deep.

28:46.240 --> 28:47.720
Please have a drink.

29:08.990 --> 29:10.110
They dance so well.

29:11.550 --> 29:12.750
I'm truly impressed.

29:19.350 --> 29:21.410
I didn't drink myself to death, did I?

29:22.110 --> 29:23.370
You're finally alive?

29:25.830 --> 29:27.090
Where is His Highness?

29:27.240 --> 29:28.960
He left the next day.

29:29.070 --> 29:29.880
He wants us

29:30.510 --> 29:32.310
to visit Horqin again next year.

29:32.830 --> 29:33.560
Sounds good.

29:34.000 --> 29:36.060
I'll wait until next year to die then.

29:37.000 --> 29:38.000
Do you remember

29:38.000 --> 29:40.800
how you cried while
hugging His Highness that day?

29:41.640 --> 29:42.500
I didn't, did I?

29:42.880 --> 29:44.270
No one could understand
what you were saying.

29:44.270 --> 29:46.470
It took several people to pull you away.

29:48.920 --> 29:49.720
You're making this up, aren't you?

29:49.720 --> 29:50.640
Why do I recall that

29:50.640 --> 29:51.990
I passed out early

29:52.050 --> 29:53.350
and just collapsed?

29:54.400 --> 29:56.730
His Highness even promised you his sword.

29:57.110 --> 30:00.200
He also said he'd make you Horqin's...

30:02.830 --> 30:03.550
Baturu.

30:03.790 --> 30:04.680
What Turu?

30:06.550 --> 30:07.310
Baturu.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.200
It means

30:10.480 --> 30:11.830
warrior.

30:16.350 --> 30:17.350
Some warrior I am.

30:20.920 --> 30:22.350
You've been drunk for a day.

30:22.350 --> 30:23.650
Eat something. Here.

30:23.830 --> 30:25.030
Don't make me eat now.

30:25.110 --> 30:26.040
I feel terrible.

30:27.830 --> 30:28.880
My father said

30:29.070 --> 30:30.680
eating a little would sober you up.

30:30.680 --> 30:31.200
Be good.

30:31.750 --> 30:33.540
My whole body is

30:33.590 --> 30:34.880
in turmoil.

30:35.550 --> 30:37.030
One bite and I'll throw up.

30:42.750 --> 30:43.640
Take one bite

30:44.310 --> 30:45.400
and I'll let you

30:45.920 --> 30:46.510
hug me.

30:49.200 --> 30:49.930
Give it here.

31:08.400 --> 31:09.460
Have another bite.

31:18.950 --> 31:22.410
[Gu's Mansion]

31:23.130 --> 31:25.740
[Spring Breeze of Yi River]

31:30.920 --> 31:31.440
Mother.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.160
Here.

31:33.350 --> 31:34.960
Don't just say it's good.

31:35.070 --> 31:36.270
Tell me if there's any problem.

31:36.270 --> 31:37.200
I'll make adjustments.

31:37.200 --> 31:39.110
So I'll know exactly what to do next time.

31:39.110 --> 31:39.920
Alright.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.880
I'm not that picky.

31:45.270 --> 31:46.350
I cooked too much lately,

31:46.350 --> 31:47.880
but it's really not my fault.

31:47.880 --> 31:48.790
Who knew in this house

31:48.790 --> 31:50.480
I'd be the only real man left standing.

31:50.480 --> 31:51.070
Look at

31:51.270 --> 31:51.880
Mr. Chang,

31:52.150 --> 31:52.810
Mr. Liao,

31:53.200 --> 31:54.060
and my brother.

31:54.510 --> 31:55.270
They barely had a few drinks

31:55.270 --> 31:56.800
before they all passed out.

31:57.000 --> 31:58.030
Hurry up and eat.

31:58.960 --> 32:00.550
I've been eating leftovers for days.

32:00.550 --> 32:02.280
Let them sleep a little longer.

32:06.480 --> 32:07.070
You're awake.

32:07.070 --> 32:07.670
Pingyuan.

32:08.030 --> 32:08.760
Come eat now.

32:13.400 --> 32:15.060
Mother, how long was I out for?

32:15.920 --> 32:16.790
Three days.

32:17.680 --> 32:18.880
You must be starving.

32:19.510 --> 32:20.310
Eat quickly.

32:20.750 --> 32:22.200
Yu'er cooked today.

32:28.880 --> 32:30.400
Look at you.

32:31.420 --> 32:32.550
Getting that drunk.

32:33.110 --> 32:35.570
You've made history
with how drunk you were.

32:36.070 --> 32:37.480
Your snoring was so loud that

32:37.480 --> 32:39.280
the whole village could hear it.

32:45.480 --> 32:46.410
I'm done eating.

32:46.640 --> 32:47.630
Slow down.

32:47.750 --> 32:49.350
No one's fighting you for it.

32:59.590 --> 33:00.350
Did you make this?

33:00.350 --> 33:01.960
Your cooking skills are good.

33:01.960 --> 33:03.490
So you can taste things now?

33:03.720 --> 33:05.330
I remember you told me

33:05.680 --> 33:07.880
I could hug you for every bite I take.

33:09.080 --> 33:11.340
Your memory works fine when it suits you.

33:11.750 --> 33:14.180
A moment of spring night
is worth a thousand gold...

33:14.180 --> 33:15.550
I've lost out completely.

33:15.550 --> 33:16.820
I brought a wife home

33:16.960 --> 33:18.620
and slept for 3 days straight.

33:21.400 --> 33:21.920
Wife.

33:25.680 --> 33:27.030
My dear wife.

33:27.060 --> 33:28.120
What are you doing?

33:28.510 --> 33:29.590
How did I not notice before

33:29.590 --> 33:30.590
that you're so...

33:31.200 --> 33:31.790
So what?

33:33.920 --> 33:34.720
Shameless.

33:35.720 --> 33:36.590
In front of you,

33:36.610 --> 33:37.940
what do I need shame for?

33:39.160 --> 33:40.110
What I mean is

33:40.510 --> 33:41.910
tonight, no matter what,

33:42.070 --> 33:43.730
we'll have our wedding night.

33:44.000 --> 33:45.060
Our wedding night?

33:46.030 --> 33:47.350
I'd like to see who dares to stop me.

33:47.350 --> 33:48.220
Mr. Gu.

33:52.720 --> 33:53.310
Sir.

33:55.240 --> 33:56.570
Who are you looking for?

33:58.070 --> 33:59.590
I'm Commander Zhang Erhu

33:59.590 --> 34:00.240
of the Tiger Battalion.

34:00.240 --> 34:01.970
Paying my respects to you, sir.

34:02.440 --> 34:03.700
I'm not any kind of sir.

34:04.240 --> 34:05.270
You don't need to bow like this.

34:05.270 --> 34:06.000
Please rise.

34:08.510 --> 34:09.920
Sir, you are the imperial
Pacification Commissioner.

34:09.920 --> 34:10.920
Have you forgotten?

34:10.920 --> 34:12.440
His Excellency sent us here.

34:12.440 --> 34:14.070
He said that although
you hold no official position,

34:14.070 --> 34:15.320
you have a noble status.

34:15.320 --> 34:16.840
He ordered us not to be disrespectful.

34:16.840 --> 34:18.190
We were afraid of being improper,

34:18.190 --> 34:19.000
so we posted men to keep watch

34:19.000 --> 34:20.190
until you sobered up.

34:20.190 --> 34:20.800
Only then did we brothers

34:20.800 --> 34:22.800
dare to come in and pay our respects.

34:22.800 --> 34:24.710
You're from
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office?

34:24.710 --> 34:25.880
His Excellency is waiting

34:25.880 --> 34:27.070
for you in Nanjing.

34:27.800 --> 34:29.440
Let's leave after you finish eating,

34:29.440 --> 34:29.880
Mr. Gu.

34:30.800 --> 34:31.710
You're going out?

34:31.710 --> 34:33.020
Why didn't you tell me?

34:33.110 --> 34:33.550
No,

34:33.630 --> 34:34.800
where am I supposed to go?

34:34.800 --> 34:36.550
We're escorting you to Nanjing, of course.

34:36.550 --> 34:38.360
Didn't you promise His Excellency

34:38.360 --> 34:40.320
that you'd start work 3 days
after your wedding?

34:40.320 --> 34:41.449
It's been 3 days now.

34:42.000 --> 34:42.960
How can I just leave? I...

34:42.960 --> 34:44.360
I need to prepare first.

34:44.800 --> 34:45.770
May I ask

34:45.880 --> 34:47.110
what preparations you need?

34:47.110 --> 34:48.570
My men can help you.

34:49.150 --> 34:49.920
Well, you see,

34:49.920 --> 34:50.920
I just got married

34:51.590 --> 34:52.840
and I have a big family,

34:52.840 --> 34:54.030
I can't just leave whenever I want.

34:54.030 --> 34:55.360
His Excellency has instructed us on this.

34:55.360 --> 34:56.800
He said that you are a filial son.

34:56.800 --> 34:57.800
So no matter what,

34:57.840 --> 34:59.150
we're to bring your entire family

34:59.150 --> 35:00.150
to Nanjing with you.

35:00.150 --> 35:02.000
This way, you won't miss your parents

35:02.000 --> 35:03.360
and be unable to focus on your work.

35:03.360 --> 35:04.820
We'll be waiting outside.

35:05.190 --> 35:06.190
When you finish eating,

35:06.190 --> 35:06.880
just let us know.

35:06.880 --> 35:08.410
We'll depart immediately.

35:10.400 --> 35:11.440
My respects to you, Sir.

35:11.440 --> 35:12.920
My respects, Sir.

35:22.000 --> 35:22.570
So...

35:23.480 --> 35:25.280
Too late for your wedding night?

35:25.550 --> 35:27.150
Too late to even kill myself.

35:47.000 --> 35:47.800
Gentlemen,

35:48.320 --> 35:49.150
it's just one more day and night

35:49.150 --> 35:50.510
before we reach Jiangning.

35:50.510 --> 35:51.850
You don't need to stand here like this.

35:51.850 --> 35:52.440
It must be tiring.

35:52.440 --> 35:53.240
Go in and rest.

35:53.360 --> 35:53.960
Mr. Gu.

35:55.320 --> 35:56.770
Standing guard for you

35:56.920 --> 35:57.720
is not tiring.

35:57.800 --> 35:59.530
My mother thinks you're tired.

35:59.820 --> 36:01.150
She specifically instructed me

36:01.150 --> 36:02.280
to insist that you gentlemen

36:02.280 --> 36:03.510
go and rest in the cabin.

36:03.510 --> 36:05.070
Refreshments have been prepared
in the cabin.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.530
Relax and have a good chat.

36:06.630 --> 36:07.690
We'll arrive soon.

36:07.960 --> 36:08.320
Alright.

36:08.320 --> 36:08.960
-Alright.
-Alright.

36:08.960 --> 36:10.620
Then you take the first shift.

36:14.480 --> 36:14.960
Please.

36:30.630 --> 36:32.280
Where are you from, General Li?

36:32.280 --> 36:33.590
I'm from Liuyang.

36:33.920 --> 36:34.780
Liuyang, I see.

36:35.480 --> 36:36.070
Mr. Gu,

36:37.230 --> 36:38.560
in Nanjing,

36:38.710 --> 36:40.480
hundreds of thousands of troops
are stranded.

36:40.480 --> 36:42.000
The imperial court wants to disband them,

36:42.000 --> 36:43.460
but can't pay their wages.

36:43.880 --> 36:45.480
The resentment among the men

36:45.550 --> 36:47.280
is growing stronger by the day.

36:48.030 --> 36:48.710
Mr. Gu,

36:49.630 --> 36:52.760
these soldiers have fought bloody battles
for 10 years.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.820
They're not ordinary civilians.

36:54.990 --> 36:56.300
Even we commanders

36:56.400 --> 36:57.980
are afraid.

36:59.920 --> 37:00.920
Jiangning

37:01.000 --> 37:03.260
is about to become a powder keg, isn't it?

37:04.030 --> 37:04.630
That's why

37:05.000 --> 37:06.530
we need a master strategist

37:06.710 --> 37:08.910
to manage and stabilize the situation.

37:09.550 --> 37:10.950
When we brothers set out,

37:11.000 --> 37:12.060
we were instructed

37:12.070 --> 37:14.000
that if you lost even a single hair,

37:14.070 --> 37:15.340
all four of us brothers

37:15.400 --> 37:17.510
would have to forfeit our heads.

37:18.190 --> 37:19.880
You all know perfectly well

37:20.360 --> 37:22.490
that you're pushing me into a fire pit.

37:22.800 --> 37:23.560
Right now,

37:23.840 --> 37:26.110
the morale of the troops
is quite unstable, isn't it?

37:26.110 --> 37:26.920
Indeed,

37:27.190 --> 37:29.190
it's been almost a year without pay.

37:29.790 --> 37:30.590
But Sir,

37:31.110 --> 37:33.550
none of us truly wants to rebel.

37:33.960 --> 37:35.560
However, if pushed too hard,

37:36.000 --> 37:38.130
men accustomed to bloodshed

37:38.190 --> 37:39.590
might cause chaos again.

37:40.400 --> 37:42.660
It's frightening just to think about it.

37:42.700 --> 37:43.900
That must not happen.

37:44.840 --> 37:45.880
When I was in Shanghai before,

37:45.880 --> 37:48.510
I saw those foreigners with
their powerful warships and cannons.

37:48.510 --> 37:50.040
They were like wild beasts,

37:50.320 --> 37:52.250
ready to devour anyone they chose.

37:52.480 --> 37:54.480
Our country has been weak for so long.

37:54.480 --> 37:55.400
If another conflict happens,

37:55.400 --> 37:57.400
the entire nation will be finished.

37:58.670 --> 37:59.660
I

37:59.920 --> 38:01.650
will do everything in my power.

38:02.840 --> 38:05.030
Sir, you have such a compassionate heart.

38:05.030 --> 38:05.800
The four of us brothers

38:05.800 --> 38:07.230
will ensure your safety

38:07.510 --> 38:08.190
even if

38:08.710 --> 38:09.880
it costs our lives.

38:10.840 --> 38:13.110
May you succeed
in all your endeavors, Mr. Gu.

38:13.110 --> 38:14.370
May I succeed, indeed.

38:14.670 --> 38:16.730
Alright, I'll take your good wishes.

38:21.110 --> 38:22.230
I know you've been drunk

38:22.230 --> 38:23.490
the past few days, Sir.

38:23.840 --> 38:24.590
Today,

38:25.070 --> 38:27.470
you'll consummate your marriage on board.

38:27.920 --> 38:28.880
I've specially prepared

38:28.880 --> 38:30.540
an opera troupe and a drum band

38:31.030 --> 38:32.560
to set the mood for you, Sir.

38:34.030 --> 38:35.560
How do you know everything?

38:35.670 --> 38:36.630
That's not necessary.

38:36.630 --> 38:37.000
Sir.

38:37.000 --> 38:37.860
Not necessary!

38:38.710 --> 38:39.440
Sir.

39:31.030 --> 39:31.890
Let me taste it.

39:38.150 --> 39:39.210
Why is this so sour?

39:39.280 --> 39:40.010
What is this?

39:40.440 --> 39:41.170
Fruit juice?

39:42.320 --> 39:43.170
Sir,

39:43.280 --> 39:44.340
this is pear juice.

39:44.360 --> 39:46.690
It's for rinsing your mouth after eating.

39:47.030 --> 39:47.510
That's enough.

39:47.510 --> 39:48.550
You don't need to wait on us anymore.

39:48.550 --> 39:49.230
And you all.

39:49.510 --> 39:50.150
You may go.

39:51.230 --> 39:51.920
Yes.

40:01.190 --> 40:02.110
Come, Mother.

40:03.280 --> 40:04.340
Have some chicken.

40:06.480 --> 40:07.150
Mr. Chang,

40:07.960 --> 40:08.820
this is for you.

40:10.880 --> 40:11.960
This piece is bigger,

40:11.960 --> 40:12.760
for Mr. Liao.

40:13.480 --> 40:15.610
Everyone else, please help yourself.

40:19.670 --> 40:20.800
What's wrong

40:20.800 --> 40:22.000
with all of you?

40:24.320 --> 40:25.450
Look at this spread.

40:25.960 --> 40:27.440
Chicken, duck, fish, shrimp, and goose.

40:27.440 --> 40:28.590
Were they your relatives?

40:28.590 --> 40:29.910
Even if they were, they're cooked now.

40:29.910 --> 40:30.580
Eat up.

40:31.480 --> 40:32.000
Be quiet

40:32.000 --> 40:33.730
if you have nothing good to say.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.000
Everyone is looking so gloomy

40:36.000 --> 40:37.840
like you've boarded a pirate ship.

40:37.840 --> 40:39.370
You've ruined my appetite.

40:44.190 --> 40:44.840
Pingyuan.

40:47.150 --> 40:49.080
What trouble have you gotten into?

40:52.480 --> 40:53.210
I don't know.

40:54.710 --> 40:56.710
Such humble words and lavish gifts.

40:56.890 --> 40:57.880
It seems

40:58.510 --> 41:00.070
they want to buy your life.

41:04.880 --> 41:06.410
If they only wanted my life,

41:06.710 --> 41:07.770
that would be fine.

41:08.230 --> 41:09.630
But they've gone too far.

41:10.760 --> 41:13.090
They're betting my whole family's lives.

41:14.920 --> 41:15.580
Whose life?

41:17.480 --> 41:18.280
Don't you know

41:18.510 --> 41:19.150
I'm going to Nanjing

41:19.150 --> 41:20.110
to handle something?

41:20.110 --> 41:20.880
I know.

41:21.840 --> 41:22.670
Aren't you going to Nanjing

41:22.670 --> 41:23.670
to be an official?

41:24.230 --> 41:25.360
It's not that.

41:26.440 --> 41:28.170
If this matter is handled well,

41:28.710 --> 41:30.040
we can all return alive.

41:30.880 --> 41:32.480
But if it's not handled well,

41:34.360 --> 41:35.360
all of us here

41:35.760 --> 41:36.760
will be beheaded.

41:39.510 --> 41:39.960
Gosh.

41:40.630 --> 41:41.230
Pingyuan.

41:43.030 --> 41:44.160
I don't understand.

41:44.880 --> 41:45.920
When others become officials,

41:45.920 --> 41:47.000
they make fortunes

41:47.360 --> 41:49.090
and marry several concubines.

41:49.150 --> 41:50.090
But you?

41:50.280 --> 41:51.000
You've put my head

41:51.000 --> 41:52.190
on the line too.

41:56.590 --> 41:57.670
One year ago...

42:00.030 --> 42:02.490
Rogue soldiers passed through the village.

42:02.710 --> 42:03.480
Everyone in the village

42:03.480 --> 42:05.280
hid in the caves.

42:06.880 --> 42:09.340
The soldiers loitered
for more than 10 days.

42:10.190 --> 42:12.400
Everyone had nothing to eat or drink,

42:12.400 --> 42:13.400
and it was so cold.

42:15.280 --> 42:17.140
But we didn't dare to light a fire.

42:17.480 --> 42:18.440
That time,

42:19.150 --> 42:21.280
dozens of children and elderly people

42:21.360 --> 42:23.440
fell asleep and never woke up again.

42:24.630 --> 42:26.150
They starved to death.

42:27.800 --> 42:29.360
Life isn't ours to control.

42:30.800 --> 42:33.070
Heaven takes it whenever it wants.

42:33.550 --> 42:35.480
But wasn't that because of the war?

42:37.070 --> 42:38.070
So, why now...

42:45.790 --> 42:46.720
Do you regret it?

42:51.800 --> 42:52.530
Son-in-law,

42:53.110 --> 42:55.040
I just want to ask you one question.

42:55.880 --> 42:57.250
Are they asking you

42:57.280 --> 42:58.840
to do anything immoral?

43:01.760 --> 43:02.280
No.
